lines=['Intended mind change: Replace the first four scoped keeps’ purely chronological access with a decision index that retains their exceptions and changes the next source-relation analysis.','','# Consolidation 01 — what kind of obstacle controls the next use?','','Inputs are only K1–K4 below. No new substantive finding enters this consolidation. The starting arrangement is the existing chronological four-record list; it is credible and preserves all evidence. The proposed alternative indexes the same findings by the concrete obstacle in the next use. Actor: the current model’s lookup/selection operation, not human reading performance.','','| Keep | Retained finding | Scope | Exception | Provenance |','|---|---|---|---|---|']
for x in findings:lines.append('| '+' | '.join([x['id'],x['finding'],x['scope'],x['exception'],x['source']])+' |')
